the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 14.

the actions are:
    the move set with *an index* and *a second index* is made; known as set.

the fluents are:
    control *a thing*; known as control.
    *an index* on *a second index*; known as on.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move set with *an index* and *a second index* is legal; known as legal_set.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *an index* is an index.

the knowledge base switches includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/switches.hrf".

